// GovernanceValidationResult — the outcome of an advisory authorisation check
// (Graph.canAddTriple / Graph.canPerformAction, §11). The reject fields are
// absent when `allowed` is true.

dictionary GovernanceValidationResult {
  required boolean allowed;
  USVString? rejectedBy;      // constraint id that rejected the operation
  USVString? constraintKind;  // "capability" | <plug-in kind>
  USVString? reason;
  DOMString? mode;            // current enforcement mode token
};
